      "instance_name": "ableism_developmental_disability_infantilization",
      "label": "Developmental disability infantilization",
      "description": "The meme implicitly references the stereotype of infantilizing people with developmental disabilities by using the slur 'retard' to mock their perceived lack of sophistication or maturity. This is a form of ableism that reduces individuals to childlike or incompetent status.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
