      "label": "Intelligence mockery",
      "description": "The meme uses the slur 'retard' to mock the intelligence or competence of the person depicted, which is a form of ableism that targets individuals with intellectual disabilities. This stereotype is rooted in real-world prejudice and is not visible in the image.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
